WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.240
Dear Jesus, may I enter into the eternal divine order of God to place my absolute nothingness

2
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:14.800
in the heart of the most holy trinity, to give to my God the joy of fulfilling the purpose of

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:21.360
my existence by doing all the act of my life through the immaculate heart of my mother Mary

4
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:30.240
and in the divine will of God, and in this same manner may I live, pray, act, eat, walk, sleep,

5
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:37.040
and do everything. May my soul be devoid of any other longings, wants, or desires, and may you,

6
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:44.160
my beloved divine will, do with me whatever you want or desire. All I ask is that you bind me to

7
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:51.280
your most holy will so intimately that I may never swear from carrying out what I know to be your

8
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:58.640
good pleasure, and that I remain so docile to the movements of your divine will that you never perceive

9
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:05.760
even a breath of resistance in my soul to your requests of me. Come divine will with all the

10
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:12.480
angels and saints, especially my sweet mother Mary, to touch my forehead, to imprint on it the holy

11
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:19.440
spirit and infuse in me true light, so that I may understand the truths and the good that are in

12
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:28.320
these writings and prayers. Amen. So good evening everyone, we want to start at August the 22nd,

13
00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:38.800
1926, and we have some very meaty messages this evening to deal with. So Louisa said I feel as though

14
00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:47.360
immersed in the eternal will of my adorable Jesus, and as much as I can, I do my round through the

15
00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:54.080
whole of creation to keep company with all the acts of the divine will that operates in it.

16
00:01:54.080 --> 00:02:03.600
So here is Louisa doing her part in entering in to continue her rounds of giving praise and

17
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:10.480
adoration to God, and she will do this whether she feels well or unwell, whether she feels tired or

18
00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:18.160
not, she will continue. But while I was doing this, she said my highest and only good made himself

19
00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:26.560
seen in my interior because the kingdom of God is within. And he looked at all of me. So there is

20
00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:34.960
a kind of an x-ray vision in which the Lord can see every single aspect of you. Well, Hebrews 4,

21
00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:42.240
12 says that the word of God can penetrate into our innermost being that separates the soul from

22
00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:48.560
the spirit and joins from the marrow. And here Louisa is experiencing this x-ray vision in which

23
00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:55.760
God can see absolutely everything. But what he was doing was he wasn't doing this in judgment

24
00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:02.640
over his friend Louisa. He was counting all of my acts one by one and placing them around himself

25
00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:08.880
to enjoy them as if they were bouquets. It's absolutely amazing. So he said, my daughter,

